          <h2>How Can You Spot a Fake Profile Before Answering?</h2>

          <p>
            You rarely need advanced technology to identify suspicious accounts. Careful observation is often enough. Instead of focusing only on profile pictures, examine the overall consistency of the account.
          </p>

